# TripWise AI — Frontend Production Environment Variables Example
# Set VITE_API_BASE_URL in your Vercel Project Environment Variables.
# NEVER include backend secrets (JWT secret, DB credentials, AI API keys) in frontend env vars!

# For production (Vercel deployment):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-name.onrender.com

# For local development:
# Leave unset or use default Vite dev proxy (/api):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
